    "text": "Consider the given chemical reaction sequence :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/pPtOtPbRzHGk4jO9-w6Yv8ctD-DnaItA8tix6iNnkqQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br />Total sum of oxygen atoms in Product A and Product B are _______",
